     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The days",
     "texto": [
      "**星期一** is Monday, **星期二**, Tuesday, up to **星期六**, Saturday. For Sunday you say **星期天**. **周末** is the weekend. Chinese has no capital letters, so the days are not capitalized (unlike English «Monday»)."
     ],
